flowchart TD
  A[Research request] --> B[Collect source snippets]
  B --> C[LLM extraction layer]
  C --> D[Structured JSON draft]
  D --> E{Schema valid?}
  E -- No --> F[Repair prompt or fallback parser]
  F --> D
  E -- Yes --> G{Confidence sufficient?}
  G -- Yes --> H[Human review: quick approve]
  G -- No --> I[Human review: inspect evidence]
  H --> J[Approved structured output]
  I --> J
  J --> K[Downstream workflow handoff]

